# Config secrets — classes.yaml's Drive folder IDs act as shareable view-links (folders
# are "anyone with the link"), and this is a public repo; service_account.json is a real
# credential. Both are supplied to CI as GitHub Actions secrets instead. Templates aren't
# sensitive and are tracked normally.
config/classes.yaml
config/service_account.json

